    "text": "Kenya Meteorological Department (KMD) — forecast for Kisumu\nValid for 2026-09-26.\nMax 31.0C / Min 19.0C.\nTonight: Partly cloudy\nMorning: Sunny intervals\nAfternoon: Sunny intervals, chance of light showers over few places.\nNational outlook mentions this area:\n  - Light to moderate rains expected over few places across Kakamega, Kericho, Kisumu, Bomet, Busia,",
